      "v": 3,
      "zh": "但亚扪人的首领对他们的主哈嫩说：「大卫差人来安慰你，你想他是尊敬你父亲吗？他差臣仆来不是详察窥探、要倾覆这城吗？」",
      "en": "the Ammonite officials said to their lord Hanun, “Do you really think David is trying to honor your father by sending these messengers to express his sympathy?[NOTE:1] No, David has sent his servants to you to get information about the city and spy on it so they can overthrow it!”[NOTE:2]",
      "notes": [
